  "caveats": [
    "Rptor and Mtor RNA perturbations are negative transcriptional comparators, not rapalog or genetic rescue assays.",
    "Pik3cb was weak in the same neuronal strata despite literature in PTEN-deficient tumors, so the screen does not justify treating p110beta loss as a neuronal PTEN proxy."
  ],
